# world-depth -- G16 acceptance seeds (ROADMAP-playable "G16 World depth").
# Crush: a Rhino ordered over an enemy GI's cell kills it by driving over it.
# Garrison / bridges have no probe keys yet (reserved: occupants(H,ID),
# bridge_cells); add their steps when the phase lands.
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
cheat spawn HTNK 0 building 0:GACNST +4 +4
cheat spawn E1 1 building 0:GACNST +9 +4
wait 2
let l1 = units_lost(1)
click unit 0:HTNK
assert selected >= 1
click unit 1:E1
wait 2
until 300 units_lost(1) > $l1                 @G-47:C
shot crush
end
